# Purpose

This document defines the platform engineering standards for using Supabase throughout the hubIO platform.

Its purpose is to establish consistent architectural principles for leveraging Supabase as the platform foundation while preserving business integrity, scalability, maintainability, and long-term flexibility.

---

# Scope

This standard defines:

* Platform philosophy
* Platform responsibilities
* Platform boundaries
* Service ownership
* Platform governance
* Platform evolution

It intentionally excludes product-specific implementation, framework APIs, SQL definitions, authentication flows, storage implementation, and realtime configuration, which are defined by their respective Engineering Standards.

---

# Constitutional Interpretation

This document extends the hubIO Engineering Constitution.

It applies constitutional engineering principles to the Supabase platform, ensuring platform capabilities remain aligned with business architecture rather than dictating it.

